*Romania advanced to play Croatia (runner-up of [[1998 FIFA World Cup Group H|Group H]]) in the [[1998 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Romania vs Croatia|round of 16]].
*England advanced to play Argentina (winner of [[1998 FIFA World Cup Group H|Group H]]) in the [[1998 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Argentina vs England|round of 16]].

